================================================================================

SCENARIO:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

User types:

John

into:

Name


FLOW:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

User Types "John"
        ↓
Input Emits Change
        ↓
handleChange(event)
        ↓
Read:

name = "name"
value = "John"

        ↓
Functional State Update
        ↓

previousData:

{
  name: '',
  email: ''
}

        ↓

nextData:

{
  name: 'John',
  email: ''
}

        ↓
React Processes State Update
        ↓
SimpleForm Renders
        ↓
value={formData.name}
        ↓
Input Shows "John"
        ↓
Live Display Shows:

Name: John


================================================================================
STEP-BY-STEP TABLE
================================================================================

+------+-----------------------------+----------------------------------+
| STEP | ACTION                      | RESULT                           |
+------+-----------------------------+----------------------------------+
| 1    | User types John             | Input edit occurs                |
| 2    | onChange runs               | Handler receives event           |
| 3    | Read name/value             | name + John                      |
| 4    | Create next object          | Existing fields preserved        |
| 5    | setFormData(...)            | State update requested           |
| 6    | React renders               | Current state used               |
| 7    | value prop updates          | Input displays John              |
| 8    | Display reads state         | Name: John                       |
+------+-----------------------------+----------------------------------+


