================================================================================
2. CHECKBOX
================================================================================

Checkboxes require special handling because their primary controlled value is:

checked

not:

value


STATE:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

{
  subscribe: false
}


JSX:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

<input
  type="checkbox"
  name="subscribe"
  checked={formData.subscribe}
  onChange={handleChange}
/>


UPDATED GENERIC HANDLER:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

const handleChange = (event) => {

  const {
    name,
    value,
    type,
    checked
  } = event.target


  setFormData(previousData => ({

    ...previousData,

    type === 'checkbox'
        ? checked
        : value

  }))
}


