================================================================================
CRITICAL FORM SETUP POINTS
================================================================================

• Controlled Input
  - React state provides the displayed value

• name
  - Identifies the state property

• value
  - Controls text/select input value

• checked
  - Controls checkbox/radio checked state

• onChange
  - Processes the user's input

• Spread
  - Preserves unrelated form fields

• Computed Property

value

  - Updates the matching field dynamically

• Functional State Update

setFormData(previous => ({
  ...previous,
  value
}))

  - Builds next state from previous state

• Labels
  - Use htmlFor and matching id

• Submission
  - Handle separately through onSubmit


